<html>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #111; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
      <h1 style="color: #1370c6; margin: 0;">Omnicassion</h1>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
      <div style="background: #dcfce7; width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        <span style="color: #16a34a; font-size: 32px;">&#10003;</span>
      </div>
      <h2 style="margin: 0; color: #16a34a;">Congratulations!</h2>
    </div>

    <p>Hello,</p>

    <p>Great news! Your claim for <strong>{{businessName}}</strong> has been <strong style="color: #16a34a;">approved</strong>.</p>

    <p>You now have full access to manage your business profile on Omnicassion.</p>

    <div style="background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 24px 0;">
      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #166534;">What you can do now:</h3>
      <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #166534;">
        <li>Complete your business profile with photos and description</li>
        <li>Add your services and pricing</li>
        <li>Upload your portfolio to showcase your work</li>
        <li>Start receiving inquiries from potential clients</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p style="text-align: center; margin: 24px 0;">
      <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" style="background: #16a34a; color: #fff; padding: 14px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; display: inline-block; font-weight: bold;">Go to Your Dashboard</a>
    </p>

    {{#if reviewNotes}}
    <div style="background: #f4f4f5; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 24px 0;">
      <p style="margin: 0; color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
        <strong>Note from our team:</strong><br>
        {{reviewNotes}}
      </p>
    </div>
    {{/if}}

    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7; margin: 24px 0;" />

    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
      Need help getting started? Check out our <a href="{{helpUrl}}" style="color: #1370c6;">vendor guide</a> or contact our support team.
    </p>

    <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">
      &copy; {{currentYear}} Omnicassion. All rights reserved.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
